<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Dec industrial production up 11.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Dec industrial production up 11.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's December industrial activity rose 11.2 percent compared with December 1995, and for the year 1996 was up 10.78 percent, the Finance Ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>The rise was greater than a 10.17 percent average forecast in a Reuters survey.</p>
